---
title: "One command for one step of a run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: idle
    lg1: working
    lg2: recovery
    lg3: recorded
    lg4: Breaks UncertainStaysBlocked
    lg5: Path to the UncertainStaysBlocked bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: Not sent
  s1: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called
  s2: Result in hand, not recorded
  s3: On record as running, no worker left
  s4: Worker still going, its lease gone
  s5: Marked uncertain, reconciliation queued
  s6: Recorded complete
  s7: Recorded failed
  s8: Recorded uncertain by its worker
  s9: Recorded waiting for a person or a check
  s10: Recorded complete, step rejected later
  s11: Uncertain, but the step is open again
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caller sends the command
  s1 --> s2: the handler is called and returns or the call is stopped before the handler
  s1 --> s3: the worker dies
  s1 --> s4: the lease runs out
  s1 --> s5: the run is cancelled: marked uncertain
  s2 --> s3: the worker dies
  s2 --> s4: the lease runs out
  s2 --> s6: the result is recorded as complete
  s2 --> s5: the run is cancelled: marked uncertain
  s2 --> s7: the result is recorded as failed
  s3 --> s5: the run is cancelled: marked uncertain or the same id is sent again: marked uncertain
  s2 --> s8: the result is recorded as uncertain
  s2 --> s9: the result is recorded as waiting
  s4 --> s5: the run is cancelled: marked uncertain or the same id is sent again: marked uncertain
  s4 --> s3: the worker dies or the late result is refused
  s8 --> s8: revalidation takes the lease
  s6 --> s10: revalidation rejects this step or an earlier one
  s5 --> s11: revalidation rejects an earlier step
  s8 --> s11: revalidation rejects an earlier step
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 orange
  class s4 blue
  class s5 purple
  class s6 purple
  class s7 purple
  class s8 purple
  class s8 bugPath
  class s9 purple
  class s10 purple
  class s11 purple
  class s11 breaks
  class s11 bugPath
